          "review_state": "unreviewed"
        },
        {
          "step_id": "brd_temp",
          "text": "Take their temperature with the kit thermometer as its instructions say. Record the number and the time. Never delay or stop sitting them upright and watching their breathing for this.",
          "text_first_time": null,
          "who": "any_crew",
          "needs": {
